  "label": "The man is mapped as the speaker of the text 'ready for the cupcake?'",
  "description": "The top text 'ready for the cupcake?' is positioned directly above the man's head, creating a direct visual and rhetorical link. The man's aggressive, confrontational expression and pointing gesture are visually mapped onto the act of posing the question, implying he is the one asking it or representing the voice behind the question. This is an analogical mapping where the visual entity (the man) is projected as the entity performing the action or uttering the text.",
